[HELP]

APPS:

Move your mouse to the right side of the
screen to visualize the list of apps.
Click on an icon to enable the desired app.
Drag the app window to position it.
Click on the upper left side of the app
window to close it

KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS:

ESC         Return to main menu
CTRL-R     Replay
CTRL-S     Slowmotion (replay)
CTRL-A     ABS (On/Off)
CTRL-T     Traction Control (On/Off)
CTRL-H     Hides/Shows Apps on screen
CTRL-O     Restart session
CTRL-L     Disable names

VISUALS

F1         Select driving view
F3         Select TV cameras
F5         Select roll camera
F6         Select cameracar